      "headers": [
        "Question",
        "Answer"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "What does transit give you?",
          "R_p/R_\\star (radius ratio); T_eq estimate; transit timing variations → masses"
        ],
        [
          "What does RV give you?",
          "M_p sin i (minimum mass); orbital elements"
        ],
        [
          "Combined transit + RV?",
          "True density → bulk composition constraint"
        ],
        [
          "What is the Fulton gap?",
          "Bimodal R distribution at ~1.7 R_E from photoevaporation stripping H/He envelopes"
        ],
        [
          "Why are hot Jupiters there?",
          "Formed beyond 3 AU; migrated inward via disk migration or high-e tidal migration"
        ],
        [
          "What is the HZ?",
          "Range of a where liquid surface water is stable; for Sun: ~1–1.7 AU (conservative)"
        ],
        [
          "Best JWST results so far?",
          "WASP-39b CO₂; TRAPPIST-1b,c bare rock; LHS 1140b possible CO₂"
        ],
        [
          "What is a Hycean world?",
          "H₂ atmosphere over liquid water ocean (K2-18b candidate)"
        ],
        [
          "What is direct imaging contrast challenge?",
          "Earth in reflected light: ~10⁻¹⁰; current coronagraphs: ~10⁻⁷ for ground"
        ],
        [
          "When will we get rocky planet spectra?",
          "HWO era (~2040) for reflected-light spectra of HZ rocky planets"
        ],
        [
          "What is microlensing good for?",
          "Cold planets (1–5 AU), rogue planets, statistical occurrence rates"
